{"id": "280-17", "kind": "sheet-level", "path": "codegen-readback", "system": "You write self-contained Python that edits a workbook with openpyxl ONLY. No torch, no network, no pip install, no os/sys/subprocess/pathlib. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are already defined as path strings. Load INIT_XLSX, compute the answer from the real workbook (not the preview), write the graded answer cells, save to OUT_XLSX. Print exactly one line: SUMMARY_JSON={\"status\": \"ok|error\", \"notes\": \"...\"}. Never fabricate numbers — compute them from the workbook. Allowed imports: openpyxl, datetime, math, json, re, statistics, collections, itertools, copy, decimal.", "prompt": "## Instruction\nHow can I remove all rows from an Excel spreadsheet except those with the last unique entry in a specific column? I have a file with 1100 rows and 36 columns, and within one column there are some numbers that are duplicates. Specifically, in my example file, I want to keep the rows that contain the last unique number in the column, such as row 3, row 6, and so on, and then delete the other rows with duplicate numbers. An example file is provided for your reference.\n\n## Workbook (preview — read INIT_XLSX for full data)\n### Sheet: Sheet1 (showing 12x2 of 12x2)\n\tA\tB\n1\tDATA 1\t1\n2\tDATA 2\t1\n3\tDATA 3\t1\n4\tDATA 4\t2\n5\tDATA 5\t2\n6\tDATA 6\t2\n7\tDATA 7\t3\n8\tDATA 8\t3\n9\tDATA 9\t3\n10\tDATA 10\t4\n11\tDATA 11\t5\n12\tDATA 12\t5\n\n### Answer range (pinned, 24 cells)\nSheet1!A1=DATA 1\nSheet1!B1=1\nSheet1!A2=DATA 2\nSheet1!B2=1\nSheet1!A3=DATA 3\nSheet1!B3=1\nSheet1!A4=DATA 4\nSheet1!B4=2\nSheet1!A5=DATA 5\nSheet1!B5=2\nSheet1!A6=DATA 6\nSheet1!B6=2\nSheet1!A7=DATA 7\nSheet1!B7=3\nSheet1!A8=DATA 8\nSheet1!B8=3\nSheet1!A9=DATA 9\nSheet1!B9=3\nSheet1!A10=DATA 10\nSheet1!B10=4\nSheet1!A11=DATA 11\nSheet1!B11=5\nSheet1!A12=DATA 12\nSheet1!B12=5\n\n## Answer range\nSheet: Sheet1\nCells: A1:B12\nData range: A1:B12\nGraded cells: Sheet1!A1, Sheet1!B1, Sheet1!A2, Sheet1!B2, Sheet1!A3, Sheet1!B3, Sheet1!A4, Sheet1!B4, Sheet1!A5, Sheet1!B5, Sheet1!A6, Sheet1!B6, Sheet1!A7, Sheet1!B7, Sheet1!A8, Sheet1!B8, Sheet1!A9, Sheet1!B9, Sheet1!A10, Sheet1!B10, Sheet1!A11, Sheet1!B11, Sheet1!A12, Sheet1!B12\n\n\n## Skill\n### Skill: sheet reorganization\n- Never run/emit VBA or macros; implement the equivalent Python transform on the sheets.\n- When deleting rows, iterate bottom-up so indices stay valid; preserve the header row and any rows above it unless told otherwise.\n- Keep sheet names byte-exact (quotes/spaces matter). Do not create helper sheets or write outside the requested target range.\n\n### Skill: writing cells\n- Write computed VALUES (not formulas) unless the task explicitly requires formula text.\n- Write every requested answer cell; an unwritten cell scores zero. Convert Python types to plain scalars (no numpy types, no datetime objects — use ISO strings).\n\n\nReply with a single Python script in a ```python fence. No prose. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are predefined. Save OUT_XLSX and print one SUMMARY_JSON line.", "completion": "{\"cells\": [{\"cell\": \"A1\", \"value\": \"DATA 3\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B1\", \"value\": 1, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A2\", \"value\": \"DATA 6\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B2\", \"value\": 2, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A3\", \"value\": \"DATA 9\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B3\", \"value\": 3, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A4\", \"value\": \"DATA 10\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B4\", \"value\": 4, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A5\", \"value\": \"DATA 12\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B5\", \"value\": 5, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A6\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B6\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A7\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B7\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A8\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B8\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A9\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B9\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A10\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B10\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A11\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B11\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A12\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B12\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}]}", "sample_idx": 2, "latency_s": 8.3, "in_tokens": 1005, "out_tokens": 375}
{"id": "283-32", "kind": "sheet-level", "path": "codegen-readback", "system": "You write self-contained Python that edits a workbook with openpyxl ONLY. No torch, no network, no pip install, no os/sys/subprocess/pathlib. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are already defined as path strings. Load INIT_XLSX, compute the answer from the real workbook (not the preview), write the graded answer cells, save to OUT_XLSX. Print exactly one line: SUMMARY_JSON={\"status\": \"ok|error\", \"notes\": \"...\"}. Never fabricate numbers — compute them from the workbook. Allowed imports: openpyxl, datetime, math, json, re, statistics, collections, itertools, copy, decimal.", "prompt": "## Instruction\nI have four sheets in an Excel workbook. In Sheet1, I have a system snapshot, and in Sheet2, I have taken another snapshot one week later. I need a macro that can compare Sheet1 and Sheet2, and then output the differences onto Sheet3 and Sheet4. Specifically, Sheet3 should show what entries are no longer present in Sheet2 compared to Sheet1 (subtracts). Sheet4 should show what entries are present in Sheet2 that were not in Sheet1. When displayed in Sheet3 and 4, only internal data is displayed beginning on row 1, and no table headers are required. I've attached the file for reference. Make sure to exclude any duplicate entries in row two on Sheet3, there is only one row of information that should appear.\n\n## Workbook (preview — read INIT_XLSX for full data)\n### Sheet: Sheet1 (showing 32x7 of 32x7)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\n1\tXYZ\t\t\t\t\t\t\n2\tTanzania\t\t\t\t\t\t\n3\tVat 18%\t\t\t\t\t\t\n4\tLedger Account\t\t\t\t\t\t\n5\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n6\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n7\t1-Feb-2022 to 28-Feb-2022\t\t\t\t\t\t\n8\tDate\tParticulars\t\tVch Type\tVch No.\tDebit\tCredit\n9\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tOpening Balance\t\t\t2743626.43\t\n10\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tA\tSales\t040\t\t19800\n11\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tB\tSales\t041\t\t99000\n12\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tC\tSales\t042\t\t908010\n13\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tD\tSales\t043\t\t13680\n14\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tE\tSales\t044\t\t130500\n15\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tF\tSales\t045\t\t27720\n16\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tG\tSales\t046\t\t154800\n17\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tH\tSales\t047\t\t153000\n18\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tSitwipa Limited\tPurchase\t24168\t1525.42\t\n19\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tYufam Hardware and Tools\tPurchase\t59900\t36610.17\t\n20\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCash Sale Stores Ltd - Sc\tPurchase\t51582\t113491.53\t\n21\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tPyramid Graphics\tPurchase\t21843 -\t34322.03\t\n22\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tSnoopy Good Times Company\tPurchase\t40510\t5033.9\t\n23\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tTEN TO TEN SUPERMARKET\tPurchase\t9523\t1952.54\t\n24\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tThe Convenience Mart\tPurchase\t19876\t381.36\t\n25\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t001197\t152.46\t\n26\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t001159\t152.46\t\n27\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t001213\t1525.42\t\n28\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t\t1800\t\n29\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tA One Products and Bottles\tPurchase\t21181\t1220.34\t\n30\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tHajis Cash and Carry\tPurchase\t135194\t2181.36\t\n31\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tMifuko Enterprises\tPurchase\t12633\t6864.41\t\n32\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tMifuko Enterprises\tPurchase\t12666\t6864.41\t\n\n### Sheet: Sheet2 (showing 32x7 of 32x7)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\n1\tXYZ\t\t\t\t\t\t\n2\tTanzania\t\t\t\t\t\t\n3\tVat 18%\t\t\t\t\t\t\n4\tLedger Account\t\t\t\t\t\t\n5\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n6\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n7\t1-Feb-2022 to 28-Feb-2022\t\t\t\t\t\t\n8\tDate\tParticulars\t\tVch Type\tVch No.\tDebit\tCredit\n9\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tOpening Balance\t\t\t2743626.43\t\n10\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tA\tSales\t040\t\t19800\n11\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tB\tSales\t041\t\t99000\n12\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tD\tSales\t043\t\t13680\n13\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tE\tSales\t044\t\t130500\n14\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tF\tSales\t045\t\t27720\n15\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tG\tSales\t046\t\t154800\n16\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tH\tSales\t047\t\t153000\n17\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tDr\tI\tSales\t048\t\t1000\n18\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tSitwipa Limited\tPurchase\t24168\t1525.42\t\n19\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tYufam Hardware and Tools\tPurchase\t59900\t36610.17\t\n20\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCash Sale Stores Ltd - Sc\tPurchase\t51582\t113491.53\t\n21\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tPyramid Graphics\tPurchase\t21843 -\t34322.03\t\n22\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tSnoopy Good Times Company\tPurchase\t40510\t5033.9\t\n23\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tTEN TO TEN SUPERMARKET\tPurchase\t9523\t1952.54\t\n24\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tThe Convenience Mart\tPurchase\t19876\t381.36\t\n25\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t001197\t152.46\t\n26\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t001159\t152.46\t\n27\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t001213\t1525.42\t\n28\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tCrdb Bank T Shs 01J1092736200\tPayment\t\t1800\t\n29\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tA One Products and Bottles\tPurchase\t21181\t1220.34\t\n30\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tHajis Cash and Carry\tPurchase\t135194\t2181.36\t\n31\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tMifuko Enterprises\tPurchase\t12633\t6864.41\t\n32\t2022-02-01 00:00:00\tCr\tMifuko Enterprises\tPurchase\t12666\t6864.41\t\n\n### Sheet: Sheet3 (showing 1x7 of 1x7)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\n1\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n### Sheet: Sheet4 (showing 1x7 of 1x7)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\n1\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n### Answer range (pinned, 14 cells)\nSheet3!A1=\nSheet3!B1=\nSheet3!C1=\nSheet3!D1=\nSheet3!E1=\nSheet3!F1=\nSheet3!G1=\nSheet4!A1=\nSheet4!B1=\nSheet4!C1=\nSheet4!D1=\nSheet4!E1=\nSheet4!F1=\nSheet4!G1=\n\n## Answer range\nSheet: 'Sheet3','Sheet4'\nCells: Sheet3'!A:G,'Sheet4'!A:G\nData range: Sheet1!A1:G32','Sheet2!A1:G32','Sheet3!A1:G1','Sheet4!A1:G1'\nGraded cells: Sheet3!A1, Sheet3!B1, Sheet3!C1, Sheet3!D1, Sheet3!E1, Sheet3!F1, Sheet3!G1, Sheet4!A1, Sheet4!B1, Sheet4!C1, Sheet4!D1, Sheet4!E1, Sheet4!F1, Sheet4!G1\n\n\n## Skill\n### Skill: date arithmetic\n- Parse dates with datetime (try common formats); keep them as datetime objects, never strings, until the final write.\n- Day differences are (a - b).days on dates; respect inclusive/exclusive wording in the instruction. Output dates as YYYY-MM-DD (or YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS if times are involved).\n\n### Skill: sheet reorganization\n- Never run/emit VBA or macros; implement the equivalent Python transform on the sheets.\n- When deleting rows, iterate bottom-up so indices stay valid; preserve the header row and any rows above it unless told otherwise.\n- Keep sheet names byte-exact (quotes/spaces matter). Do not create helper sheets or write outside the requested target range.\n\n\nReply with a single Python script in a ```python fence. No prose. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are predefined. Save OUT_XLSX and print one SUMMARY_JSON line.", "completion": "{\"cells\": [{\"cell\": \"A1\", \"value\": \"2022-02-01T00:00:00\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"B1\", \"value\": \"Dr\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"C1\", \"value\": \"C\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"D1\", \"value\": \"Sales\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"E1\", \"value\": \"042\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"F1\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"G1\", \"value\": 908010, \"sheet\": \"Sheet3\"}, {\"cell\": \"A1\", \"value\": \"2022-02-01T00:00:00\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}, {\"cell\": \"B1\", \"value\": \"Dr\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}, {\"cell\": \"C1\", \"value\": \"I\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}, {\"cell\": \"D1\", \"value\": \"Sales\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}, {\"cell\": \"E1\", \"value\": \"048\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}, {\"cell\": \"F1\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}, {\"cell\": \"G1\", \"value\": 1000, \"sheet\": \"Sheet4\"}]}", "sample_idx":