told otherwise.\n- Keep sheet names byte-exact (quotes/spaces matter). Do not create helper sheets or write outside the requested target range.\n\n### Skill: writing cells\n- Write computed VALUES (not formulas) unless the task explicitly requires formula text.\n- Write every requested answer cell; an unwritten cell scores zero. Convert Python types to plain scalars (no numpy types, no datetime objects — use ISO strings).\n\n\nReply with a single Python script in a ```python fence. No prose. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are predefined. Save OUT_XLSX and print one SUMMARY_JSON line.", "completion": "{\"cells\": [{\"cell\": \"Z5\", \"value\": \"Y\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z6\", \"value\": \"N\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z7\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z8\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z9\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z10\", \"value\": \"Y\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z11\", \"value\": \"N\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z12\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z13\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z14\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z15\", \"value\": \"Y\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z16\", \"value\": \"N\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z17\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z18\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z19\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z20\", \"value\": \"Y\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z21\", \"value\": \"N\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z22\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z23\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z24\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z25\", \"value\": \"Y\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z26\", \"value\": \"N\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"Z27\", \"value\": \"N\", \"