ula text.\n- Write every requested answer cell; an unwritten cell scores zero. Convert Python types to plain scalars (no numpy types, no datetime objects — use ISO strings).\n\n\nReply with a single Python script in a ```python fence. No prose. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are predefined. Save OUT_XLSX and print one SUMMARY_JSON line.", "completion": "{\"cells\": [{\"cell\": \"A5\", \"value\": \"29AACCB3796P1ZV\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"B5\", \"value\": \"BEST\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"C5\", \"value\": \"GST-22-23-035\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"D5\", \"value\": \"26-Dec-2022\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"E5\", \"value\": 138369.16, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"F5\", \"value\": \"29 - Karnataka\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"G5\", \"value\": \"N\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"H5\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"I5\", \"value\": \"Regular B2B\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"J5\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"K5\", \"value\": 18, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"L5\", \"value\": 117262, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"M5\", \"value\": 21107.16, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"N5\", \"value\": 0, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"O5\", \"value\": 0, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"P5\", \"value\": 0, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"Q5\", \"value\": \"9f979b7fc381101d2b1d849f018aefe1c640c27acea3e8ab124365329191d43c\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"R5\", \"value\": \"26-Dec-2022\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"S5\", \"value\": \"Valid\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"T5\", \"value\": \"27-Dec-2022\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"U5\", \"value\": \"Auto-populated\", \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"V5\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"b2b, sez, de\"}, {\"cell\": \"