{"id": "156-14", "kind": "sheet-level", "path": "codegen-readback", "system": "You write self-contained Python that edits a workbook with openpyxl ONLY. No torch, no network, no pip install, no os/sys/subprocess/pathlib. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are already defined as path strings. Load INIT_XLSX, compute the answer from the real workbook (not the preview), write the graded answer cells, save to OUT_XLSX. Print exactly one line: SUMMARY_JSON={\"status\": \"ok|error\", \"notes\": \"...\"}. Never fabricate numbers — compute them from the workbook. Allowed imports: openpyxl, datetime, math, json, re, statistics, collections, itertools, copy, decimal.", "prompt": "## Instruction\nI attempted to write VBA code that would delete rows from row 6 onward if the cell in column F contains the text \"to be processed\" on three specific sheets named \"99250,\" \"99251,\" and \"99252.\" However, I encountered a runtime error stating that the object doesn't support the property or method. Here is the original code that caused the error: With Sheets(Array(\"99250\", \"99251\", \"99252\")) .Range(\"F5\").AutoFilter 6, \"*Accepted*\" .AutoFilter.Range.Offset(1).EntireRow.Delete .AutoFilterMode = False End With. I need help executing the same function without VBA to get my desired result.\n\n## Workbook (preview — read INIT_XLSX for full data)\n### Sheet: 99250 (showing 9x6 of 9x6)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\n1\t99250\t\t\t\t\t\n2\t\t\t\t\t\t\n3\t\t\t\t\t\t\n4\t\t\t\t\t\t\n5\tRef\tInvoice\tType\tAmount\tTransaction Number\tStatus\n6\t99329\t209215\t\t20251.25\t\tto be processed\n7\t99328\t209316\t\t19285.35\t\tAccepted\n8\t99329\t209330\t\t21380.25\t\tAccepted\n9\t\t\t\t\t\tTotal\n\n### Sheet: 99251 (showing 9x6 of 9x6)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\n1\t99251\t\t\t\t\t\n2\t\t\t\t\t\t\n3\t\t\t\t\t\t\n4\t\t\t\t\t\t\n5\tRef\tInvoice\tType\tAmount\tTransaction Number\tStatus\n6\t99500\t209501\t\t25650.25\t\tto be processed\n7\t99500\t209501\t\t27350.85\t\tAccepted\n8\t99500\t209501\t\t25915.75\t\tAccepted\n9\t\t\t\t\t\tTotal\n\n### Sheet: 99252 (showing 8x6 of 8x6)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\n1\t99252\t\t\t\t\t\n2\t\t\t\t\t\t\n3\t\t\t\t\t\t\n4\t\t\t\t\t\t\n5\tRef\tInvoice\tType\tAmount\tTransaction Number\tStatus\n6\t99605\t210400\t\t18250.65\t\tto be processed\n7\t99606\t210402\t\t20950.65\t\tto be processed\n8\t99500\t209501\t\t\t\tTotal\n\n### Answer range (pinned, 156 cells)\n99250!A1=99250\n99250!B1=\n99250!C1=\n99250!D1=\n99250!E1=\n99250!F1=\n99250!A2=\n99250!B2=\n99250!C2=\n99250!D2=\n99250!E2=\n99250!F2=\n99250!A3=\n99250!B3=\n99250!C3=\n99250!D3=\n99250!E3=\n99250!F3=\n99250!A4=\n99250!B4=\n99250!C4=\n99250!D4=\n99250!E4=\n99250!F4=\n99250!A5=Ref\n99250!B5=Invoice\n99250!C5=Type\n99250!D5=Amount\n99250!E5=Transaction Number\n99250!F5=Status\n99250!A6=99329\n99250!B6=209215\n99250!C6=\n99250!D6=20251.25\n99250!E6=\n99250!F6=to be processed\n99250!A7=99328\n99250!B7=209316\n99250!C7=\n99250!D7=19285.35\n99250!E7=\n99250!F7=Accepted\n99250!A8=99329\n99250!B8=209330\n99250!C8=\n99250!D8=21380.25\n99250!E8=\n99250!F8=Accepted\n99250!A9=\n99250!B9=\n99250!C9=\n99250!D9=\n99250!E9=\n99250!F9=Total\n99251!A1=99251\n99251!B1=\n99251!C1=\n99251!D1=\n99251!E1=\n99251!F1=\n99251!A2=\n99251!B2=\n99251!C2=\n99251!D2=\n99251!E2=\n99251!F2=\n99251!A3=\n99251!B3=\n99251!C3=\n99251!D3=\n99251!E3=\n99251!F3=\n99251!A4=\n99251!B4=\n99251!C4=\n99251!D4=\n99251!E4=\n99251!F4=\n99251!A5=Ref\n99251!B5=Invoice\n99251!C5=Type\n99251!D5=Amount\n99251!E5=Transaction Number\n99251!F5=Status\n99251!A6=99500\n99251!B6=209501\n99251!C6=\n99251!D6=25650.25\n99251!E6=\n99251!F6=to be processed\n99251!A7=99500\n99251!B7=209501\n99251!C7=\n99251!D7=27350.85\n99251!E7=\n99251!F7=Accepted\n99251!A8=99500\n99251!B8=209501\n99251!C8=\n99251!D8=25915.75\n99251!E8=\n99251!F8=Accepted\n99251!A9=\n99251!B9=\n99251!C9=\n99251!D9=\n99251!E9=\n99251!F9=Total\n99252!A1=99252\n99252!B1=\n99252!C1=\n99252!D1=\n99252!E1=\n99252!F1=\n99252!A2=\n99252!B2=\n99252!C2=\n99252!D2=\n99252!E2=\n99252!F2=\n99252!A3=\n99252!