{"id": "177-6", "kind": "sheet-level", "path": "codegen-readback", "system": "You write self-contained Python that edits a workbook with openpyxl ONLY. No torch, no network, no pip install, no os/sys/subprocess/pathlib. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are already defined as path strings. Load INIT_XLSX, compute the answer from the real workbook (not the preview), write the graded answer cells, save to OUT_XLSX. Print exactly one line: SUMMARY_JSON={\"status\": \"ok|error\", \"notes\": \"...\"}. Never fabricate numbers — compute them from the workbook. Allowed imports: openpyxl, datetime, math, json, re, statistics, collections, itertools, copy, decimal.", "prompt": "## Instruction\nI'm seeking a macro that can merge entire rows in an Excel sheet based on matching values in a specific column. In my case, when the value in Column H is identical across different rows, I want those rows consolidated into one row by merging their data.  Put the results in the 'combined' sheet, and make sure to preserve the exact formatting for each row from columns A:R when copying over.  And for the end values from columns I:R, they should be output with 2 decimals and without commas, and 0s should display as blanks.  I have provided an example spreadsheet with my data.  Once Additionally, should the reference column change, adjust the macro accordingly.\n\n## Workbook (preview — read INIT_XLSX for full data)\n### Sheet: DATA (showing 15x18 of 15x18)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\tH\tI\tJ\tK\tL\tM\tN\tO\tP\tQ\tR\n1\tMaterial\tDescription\tNumber\tKey\tProduct#\tWS\tUM\tComboKey\t2022-11-01 00:00:00\t2022-12-01 00:00:00\t2023-01-01 00:00:00\t2023-02-01 00:00:00\t2023-03-01 00:00:00\t2023-04-01 00:00:00\t2023-05-01 00:00:00\t2023-06-01 00:00:00\t2023-07-01 00:00:00\t2023-08-01 00:00:00\n2\t50000003\tTARTARIC ACID GRANULAR\t9058\t9058:50000003\t110068-DRPR\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110068-XFPR:13:US pound\t \t55.1\t \t \t \t \t \t55.1\t \t \n3\t50000003\tTARTARIC ACID GRANULAR\t9058\t9058:50000003\t110068-DRPR\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110068-XFPR:13:US pound\t250\t \t200\t \t100\t400\t250\t \t200\t \n4\t50000003\tTARTARIC ACID GRANULAR\t9058\t9058:50000003\t110068-DRPR\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110068-XFPR:13:US pound\t55\t \t \t \t \t \t55\t \t \t \n5\t50000003\tTARTARIC ACID GRANULAR\t9058\t9058:50000003\t110068-DRPR\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110068-XFPR:13:US pound\t \t \t \t \t300\t150\t \t \t \t \n6\t50000107\tPOLYETHYLENE GLYCOL 8000\t9058\t9058:50000107\t110092-5542\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110092-5542:13:US pound\t201\t201\t \t201\t201\t201\t201\t201\t \t201\n7\t50000009\tSODIUM HEXAMETAPHOSPHATE LNGCHN\t9058\t9058:50000009\t110836-2015\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110836-2015:13:US pound\t \t \t \t \t10500\t \t \t \t \t \n8\t50000009\tSODIUM HEXAMETAPHOSPHATE LNGCHN\t9058\t9058:50000009\t110836-2015\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110836-2015:13:US pound\t6720\t \t4480\t4480\t8960\t4480\t6720\t \t4480\t4480\n9\t50000009\tSODIUM HEXAMETAPHOSPHATE LNGCHN\t9058\t9058:50000009\t110836-2015\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110836-2015:13:US pound\t210\t \t \t \t \t \t210\t \t \t \n10\t50000009\tSODIUM HEXAMETAPHOSPHATE LNGCHN\t9058\t9058:50000009\t110836-2015\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110836-2015:13:US pound\t \t26880\t \t \t21600\t21600\t \t26880\t \t \n11\t50000009\tSODIUM HEXAMETAPHOSPHATE LNGCHN\t9058\t9058:50000009\t110836-2015\t13\tUS pound\t9058:110836-2015:13:US pound\t \t \t \t \t20000\t \t \t \t \t \n12\t50000104\tPHOSPHORIC ACID 75%\t9058\t9058:50000104\t100806-5626\t13\tGallon\t9058:100806-5626:13:Gallon\t60\t60\t60\t \t60\t60\t60\t60\t60\t \n13\t50000106\tCALCIUM DISODIUM EDTA\t9058\t9058:50000106\t102074-3009\t13\tUS pound\t9058:102074-3009:13:US pound\t \t \t \t \t \t \t \t \t \t \n14\t50000106\tCALCIUM DISODIUM EDTA\t9058\t9058:50000106\t102074-3009\t13\tUS pound\t9058:102074-3009:13:US pound\t55\t \t \t \t55\t \t55\t \t \t \n15\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n### Sheet: combined (showing 3x18 of 3x18)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\tH\tI\tJ\tK\tL\tM\tN\tO\tP\tQ\tR\n1\tMaterial\tDescription\tNumber\tKey\tProduct#\