{"id": "203-15", "kind": "sheet-level", "path": "codegen-readback", "system": "You write self-contained Python that edits a workbook with openpyxl ONLY. No torch, no network, no pip install, no os/sys/subprocess/pathlib. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are already defined as path strings. Load INIT_XLSX, compute the answer from the real workbook (not the preview), write the graded answer cells, save to OUT_XLSX. Print exactly one line: SUMMARY_JSON={\"status\": \"ok|error\", \"notes\": \"...\"}. Never fabricate numbers — compute them from the workbook. Allowed imports: openpyxl, datetime, math, json, re, statistics, collections, itertools, copy, decimal.", "prompt": "## Instruction\nI'm using Excel 2013 and have a main sheet that has data for staff,  which has headers in row 1 spanning from columns A to J. The names of the allowances are in column H, and I need a macro to perform the following tasks: 1) Create a new output sheet 'Output Required'; 2) Copy headers from A1 to G1 from the main sheet to the output sheet, and then copy the allowances details, which are in column H from the main sheet, into this new sheet in a transposed manner such that 'Basic', 'Housing Allowance', 'Transport Allowance', 'Other Allowance', and 'Social Allowance' will each be in separate columns; 3) Arrange the data so each staff member's output occupies only one row on the output sheet; 4) Calculate the total for each row and place it under column M on the output sheet. The cells in my provided sample are colored for explanation purposes only.\n\n## Workbook (preview — read INIT_XLSX for full data)\n### Sheet: Main (showing 14x10 of 14x10)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\tG\tH\tI\tJ\n1\tstaff no.\tDepartment\tLocation\tName\tPosition\tGender\tNationality\tDescription\tAmount\tCurrency\n2\t1111\tSales\tLOC1\tName1\tPosition1\tFemale\tUK\tBasic\t5000\tAE\n3\t1111\tSales\tLOC1\tName1\tPosition1\tFemale\tUK\tHousing Allowance\t2000\tAE\n4\t1111\tSales\tLOC1\tName1\tPosition1\tFemale\tUK\tTransport Allowances\t1500\tAE\n5\t1111\tSales\tLOC1\tName1\tPosition1\tFemale\tUK\tOther Allowances\t1750\tAE\n6\t1111\tSales\tLOC1\tName1\tPosition1\tFemale\tUK\tSocial Allowances\t250\tAE\n7\t2222\tFinance\tLOC2\tName2\tAS1\tMale\tUS\tBasic\t4000\tAE\n8\t2222\tFinance\tLOC2\tName2\tAS1\tMale\tUS\tHousing Allowance\t1500\tAE\n9\t2222\tFinance\tLOC2\tName2\tAS1\tMale\tUS\tTransport Allowances\t1500\tAE\n10\t2222\tFinance\tLOC2\tName2\tAS1\tMale\tUS\tOther Allowances\t1250\tAE\n11\t2222\tFinance\tLOC2\tName2\tAS1\tMale\tUS\tSocial Allowances\t250\tAE\n12\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n13\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n14\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n### Sheet: Output Required (showing 2x6 of 2x6)\n\tA\tB\tC\tD\tE\tF\n1\tstaff no.\tDepartment\tLocation\tName\tPosition\tGender\n2\t1111\tSales\tLOC1\tName1\tPosition1\tFemale\n\n### Answer range (pinned, 39 cells)\nOutput Required!A1=staff no.\nOutput Required!B1=Department\nOutput Required!C1=Location\nOutput Required!D1=Name\nOutput Required!E1=Position\nOutput Required!F1=Gender\nOutput Required!G1=\nOutput Required!H1=\nOutput Required!I1=\nOutput Required!J1=\nOutput Required!K1=\nOutput Required!L1=\nOutput Required!M1=\nOutput Required!A2=1111\nOutput Required!B2=Sales\nOutput Required!C2=LOC1\nOutput Required!D2=Name1\nOutput Required!E2=Position1\nOutput Required!F2=Female\nOutput Required!G2=\nOutput Required!H2=\nOutput Required!I2=\nOutput Required!J2=\nOutput Required!K2=\nOutput Required!L2=\nOutput Required!M2=\nOutput Required!A3=\nOutput Required!B3=\nOutput Required!C3=\nOutput Required!D3=\nOutput Required!E3=\nOutput Required!F3=\nOutput Required!G3=\nOutput Required!H3=\nOutput Required!I3=\nOutput Required!J3=\nOutput Required!K3=\nOutput Required!L3=\nOutput Required!M3=\n\n## Answer range\nSheet: Output Required\nCells: 'Output Required'!A1:M3\nData range: Main!'A1:J11,'Output Required!'A1:M3'\nGraded cells: Output Required!A1, Output Required!B1, Output Required!C1, Output Required!D1, Output Required!E1, Output Required!F1, Output Required!G1, Output Required!H1, Output Required!I1, Output Required!J1, Output Required!K1, Output Required!L1, Output Required!M1, Output Required!A2, Output Required!B2, Output Required!C2, Output Required!D2, Output Required!E2, Output Required!F2, Output Required!G2, Output Required!H2, Output Required!I2, Output Required!J2, Output Required!K2, Output Required!L2, Output Required!M2, Output Required!A3, Output Required!B3, Output Required!C3, Output Required!D3, Output Required!E3, Output Required!F3, Output Required!G3, Output Required!H3, Output Required!I3, Output Required!J3, Output Required!K3, Output Required!L3, Output Required!M3\n\n\n## Skill\n### Skill: sheet reorganization\n- Never run/emit VBA or macros; implement the equivalent Python transform on the sheets.\n- When deleting rows, iterate bottom-up so indices stay valid; preserve the header row and any rows above it unless told otherwise.\n- Keep sheet names byte-exact (quotes/spaces matter). Do not create helper sheets or write outside the requested target range.\n\n### Skill: formatting-gated logic\n- The instruction gates on cell appearance (highlight/fill/color). Read each cell's fill color (openpyxl `cell.fill.start_color.rgb`) and apply the transform ONLY to cells whose fill matches the stated color.\n\n\nReply with a single Python script in a ```python fence. No prose. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are predefined. Save OUT_XLSX and print one SUMMARY_JSON line.", "completion": "{\"cells\": [{\"cell\": \"A1\", \"value\": \"staff no.\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"B1\", \"value\": \"Department\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"C1\", \"value\": \"Location\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"D1\", \"value\": \"Name\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"E1\", \"value\": \"Position\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"F1\", \"value\": \"Gender\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"G1\", \"value\": \"Nationality\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"H1\", \"value\": \"Basic\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"I1\", \"value\": \"Housing Allowance\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"J1\", \"value\": \"Transport Allowances\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"K1\", \"value\": \"Other Allowances\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"L1\", \"value\": \"Social Allowances\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"M1\", \"value\": null, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"A2\", \"value\": 1111, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"B2\", \"value\": \"Sales\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"C2\", \"value\": \"LOC1\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"D2\", \"value\": \"Name1\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"E2\", \"value\": \"Position1\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"F2\", \"value\": \"Female\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"G2\", \"value\": \"UK\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"H2\", \"value\": 5000, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"I2\", \"value\": 2000, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"J2\", \"value\": 1500, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"K2\", \"value\": 1750, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"L2\", \"value\": 250, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"M2\", \"value\": 10500, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"A3\", \"value\": 2222, \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"B3\", \"value\": \"Finance\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"C3\", \"value\": \"LOC2\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"D3\", \"value\": \"Name2\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"E3\", \"value\": \"AS1\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"F3\", \"value\": \"Male\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"G3\", \"value\": \"US\", \"sheet\": \"Output Required\"}, {\"cell\": \"H3\", \"value\": 4000, \"sheet\": \"Output Require