 objects — use ISO strings).\n\n\nReply with a single Python script in a ```python fence. No prose. INIT_XLSX and OUT_XLSX are predefined. Save OUT_XLSX and print one SUMMARY_JSON line.", "completion": "{\"cells\": [{\"cell\": \"A1\", \"value\": \"URN\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B1\", \"value\": \"Date & Time\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A2\", \"value\": 1, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B2\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:01:15\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A3\", \"value\": 2, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B3\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:03:06\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A4\", \"value\": 3, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B4\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:07:55\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A5\", \"value\": 4, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B5\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:08:52\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A6\", \"value\": 5, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B6\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:09:11\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A7\", \"value\": \"5a\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B7\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:10:28\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A8\", \"value\": \"5b\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B8\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:28:16\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A9\", \"value\": \"5c\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B9\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:36:39\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A10\", \"value\": \"5d\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B10\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:42:15\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A11\", \"value\": \"5e\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B11\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:43:11\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A12\", \"value\": \"5f\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B12\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:43:49\", \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"A13\", \"value\": 6, \"sheet\": \"Sheet1\"}, {\"cell\": \"B13\", \"value\": \"06/09/2018 08:44:25\", \"sh